    dc:description "The variables and numerical decision criterion are direct, and a standard reanalysis would be decisive if embryo-level measurements were available. Publicly indexed Xenopus literature exists, but the batch provides no deposited raw voltage data, so only replication or restricted published measurements appear currently usable.";
