    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Reanalyse calibrated neural-plate voltage images and electrophysiology for nicotine-treated and control stage-15 embryos, estimate the treatment contrast in millivolts, and compare its confidence interval with the model's approximately 15 mV prediction.";
